<li>Lord John and the Hand of Devils (2007), koleksi tiga novel (Lord John and the Hellfire Club, Lord John and the Succubus and Lord John and the Haunted Soldier)</li>
<li>The Custom of the Army (2010), novel yang diterbitkan di Warriors, diedit oleh George R.R. Martin dan Gardner Dozois</li>
<li>The Scottish Prisoner (2011), novel</li>
